{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/121822-help-designing-fetish-powers","id":121822,"title":"Help designing fetish powers","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-04-29T10:17:05-07:00","id":121822,"title":"Help designing fetish powers","content":"Hello there!<br /> I have stumbled on the opportunity to forge two fetishes, a pair of melee weapons to be used together: One has a wind spirit, and the other a sea spirit, both rank 4.<br /> What kind of powers could these fetishes hold? I don't know about the scale: What can these effects be? Cold, Swiftness, Slowness, Pervasiveness and Unrelenting Forces are the things I'd love to see applied, for example.<br /> <br /> So I thought maybe one weapon helps/provokes knockback, while the other provides some defensive support. But...well, I repeat myself: How, and how strong?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse/visitormessage/1408635-visitor-message-from-synapse#post1408635\" target=\"_blank\">Check my Exalted homebrew</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse","name":"Synapse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar32_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1507"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-29T10:50:04-07:00","id":121850,"title":"","content":"If you have Lore of the Forsaken, it has an entire crafting section in the back of it. But realize that Rank 4 fetishes are fearfully strong when compared to what is presented in the Corebook. Lore basically says that a rank 4 fetish could be around for centuries and anyone wielding two of them would be powerful indeed.<br /> <br /> Some example powers given by the book are as follows for level 4 powers. Now granted that fetish crafting rules work off a point system, they could be more or less powerful depending on if you take any penalties for activation. Still, 1 of these power categories by itself would create a rank 4 fetish.<br /> <br /> \u2022 This power is a potent magical ability: mind reading, fantastic luck, concealment from magical scrying, illusions that can maim or kill.<br /> \u2022 The power directly influences the Gauntlet.<br /> \u2022 This ability exerts control over spirits in the Shadow, such as forcing spirits to become visible.<br /> \u2022 This power reduces travel time in the Shadow, or mitigates the dangers of travel there.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/444-dessembrae","name":"Dessembrae","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar444_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"362"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-30T09:17:13-07:00","id":122385,"title":"","content":"Also bare in mind that some fetishes are not necesarily direct effects. We have the Razor wire knuckles which deals lethal bleeding damage (I think thats persistent) but the actual effect is the suffering of hundreds of dead cows that sound in the opponents skull and cause very distracting effects.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> WoD-Dark Eras!! (Backed for Viking Age Werewolf)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1939-lyrics-of-war","name":"Lyrics Of War","avatar":"https://foru