":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1939-lyrics-of-war","name":"Lyrics Of War","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1939_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1769"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-30T10:30:16-07:00","id":122458,"title":"","content":"No, the Razor Wire Knuckle is from the Rage.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-30T10:57:08-07:00","id":122485,"title":"","content":"Jeeeesus I need to dust my books off again. Lemme pull that out. Op damn your right. &gt;.&gt;;; Once this semester ends I'm digging through the books again. just one more 15 page essay to go!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> WoD-Dark Eras!! (Backed for Viking Age Werewolf)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1939-lyrics-of-war","name":"Lyrics Of War","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1939_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1769"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-30T13:26:06-07:00","id":122624,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Synapse</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/121822-help-designing-fetish-powers#post121822\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hello there!<br /> I have stumbled on the opportunity to forge two fetishes, a pair of melee weapons to be used together: One has a wind spirit, and the other a sea spirit, both rank 4.<br /> What kind of powers could these fetishes hold? I don't know about the scale: What can these effects be? Cold, Swiftness, Slowness, Pervasiveness and Unrelenting Forces are the things I'd love to see applied, for example.<br /> <br /> So I thought maybe one weapon helps/provokes knockback, while the other provides some defensive support. But...well, I repeat myself: How, and how strong?</div> </div> </div> </div>The fetish would have been rank 6 . It is a very complicated fetish .<br /> <br /> I will give an example .<br /> <br /> <u><b>Wave and Gale </b></u><br /> <br /> Twin blades , the one made of sharpened granite while the other of sharpened pearl . The granite blade is Wave and possesses a lunar tidal wave elemental , and the Pearl one is Gale and possesses a lunar seawind elemental . The two spirits were once brother and sister , living together the one inside the other when tides were born across the shores of northern Ireland .<br /> The blades can be wielded apart but they will remain dormant . If both blades are held in each hand , they will wisper to the wielder their crushing seawind song and then remain silent. The blades may be activated both at the same round , devouring 1 essence each as a reflexive action and this is the only way to activate the fetishes . When the wielder does so he gains the effect of Luna's Fury gift for the round , effectively gaining all-out attack and dodge at the same time .<br /> T\u200bhe blades themselves do +2 lethal damage . Wind has durability 5 and Gale has durability 3 , when activated they gain durability 11 and 9 .","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2194,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2194-furry","user":"Furry","date":". 04-30-2014, 04:28 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2194-furry","name":"Furry","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"76"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}